    "slug": "250cc-dirt-bikes-vs-electric-power-guide",
    "title": "250cc Dirt Bikes vs Electric: Which Electric Dirt Bike Matches 250cc Power?",
    "excerpt": "Riders of 250cc dirt bikes ask what electric matches that power. Convert kW to horsepower and compare four full-size electric bikes with real prices.",
    "category": "Comparisons",
