    "slug": "2-stroke-dirt-bike-vs-electric-dirt-bike",
    "title": "2 Stroke Dirt Bike vs Electric Dirt Bike: Cost, Noise and Power",
    "excerpt": "Thinking of swapping a 2 stroke dirt bike for electric? Compare noise, servicing, power delivery and four real electric bikes with Australian prices.",
