    "slug": "best-ebike-australia-2026",
    "title": "Best Ebikes Australia 2026: Winners by Rider and Budget",
    "excerpt": "The best ebikes Australia riders can buy from EDBA stock, picked by rider and budget with real prices, batteries, ranges and warranty terms. No fake awards.",
